  "goodToKnow": "Der Rückblick is a look back: Im Rückblick (in retrospect) sieht man das klarer. At the end of December, German TV and newspapers show their Jahresrückblick, a review of the year, a New Year's Eve ritual. The opposite is der Ausblick, which means outlook or view. The verb is zurückblicken (auf)."
